---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How CGH Operations handles the information you send through this website.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>This page explains what {site.legalName} does with information you send through this website.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>You can see a price in the quote tool without giving us your name, phone number or email. The job details you enter (size and ground conditions) are sent to our server to work out the price, and we keep a plain count of how many prices were shown. That count does not identify you.</p>
      <p>If you choose to send your quote in, or you fill out the job application, we receive what you type in: your name, phone number, email, the job location and the details of your request.</p>
      <p>We also keep a daily tally of how many visitors reach each step of the quote tool and how many tap our phone number. It is a count only. It has no names, uses no cookies and does not follow you to other websites.</p>
      <h2>The map in the quote tool</h2>
      <p>If you choose to draw your area on the satellite map, the address you search for is looked up through the U.S. Census Bureau's public address finder and, if needed, OpenStreetMap's. The map pictures come from public U.S. Geological Survey, USDA and Census Bureau map services. Your drawing and the address reach us only if you send your quote in. If you tap "use my location", your phone asks your permission first, and the location is only used to move the map.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use it to respond to your request: to call, text or email you about your quote, schedule a site visit, or follow up on a job application. We do not sell your information or share it with marketers.</p>
      <h2>Calls and texts</h2>
      <p>By sending a form you agree we may contact you by phone, text or email about that request. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to any text to opt out.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Call us at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> and we will answer any question about your information or remove it on request.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
